      "title": "File:2d Division of Engineer Corps, in the Sierra Madre, New Mexico, November, 1867. (Water Shed of Continent,) 1,000 miles west of Missouri River. (Boston Public Library) (cropped).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2d/2d_Division_of_Engineer_Corps%2C_in_the_Sierra_Madre%2C_New_Mexico%2C_November%2C_1867._%28Water_Shed_of_Continent%2C%29_1%2C000_miles_west_of_Missouri_River._%28Boston_Public_Library%29_%28cropped%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2d_Division_of_Engineer_Corps,_in_the_Sierra_Madre,_New_Mexico,_November,_1867._(Water_Shed_of_Continent,)_1,000_miles_west_of_Missouri_River._(Boston_Public_Library)_(cropped).jpg",
      "width": 641,
